<title>UK: Shield shares jump after Abbott agreement.</title>
<headline>Shield shares jump after Abbott agreement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shield Diagnostics Plc jumped 36p to 372-1/2 on Thursday after the company announced an exploratory research agreement with the diagnostics division of Abbott Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>Shield said the agreement allowed it to access Abbott's instruments, reagents and training in order to technically assessing their capabilities to develop new hospital diagnostic tests. Financial terms are still to be negotiated, Shield said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
